OL,3,GNEWSA'I love the whole spirit of the
OL,4,Aplace': Kingfishr return to one of
OL,5,Atheir favourite cities
OL,6,
OL,7,FThey have been described as the hottest
OL,8,Fticket in Ireland and, after an
OL,9,Fimpromptu performance in a Londonderry
OL,10,Fpub in February, Kingfishr are back `
OL,11,Fthis time to sing to thousands.
OL,13,FThe Limerick indie-folk group will
OL,14,Fperform at Live at the Square in
OL,15,FEbrington on Monday evening in front of
OL,16,Faround six thousand fans.
OL,18,FMembers Eddie Keogh, Eoghan 'McGoo'
OL,19,FMcGrath and Eoin 'Fitz' Fitzgibbon `
OL,20,Fhave emerged as one of the top Irish
OL,21,Fbands in recent years and their
OL,22,Fpopularity is growing.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
